SUMMARY:Tactile Art Experience
DESCRIPTION:QAGOMA invites visitors who are blind or have low vision to exp
 erience art through touch and art-making. Participants explore a selected 
 sculpture through tactile access and facilitated audio description\, befor
 e creating their own raised-line drawings. Free\, bookings essential.
